    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I thought we cleaned out the cabins."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't know how he got there. He just came in all of a sudden looking for the compass, and wasn't in a mood to negotiate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I had to blow up the lab to eject him from the ship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Him and half of this ship!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Good work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is there anything from the lab left, though?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Maybe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Very well..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're going into the Skeletal Reef. The ocean lies just beyond that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You might have one last chance to repair the compass before we arrive."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "S-Señor Silver! The Alguacil is still on that ship! We must come to his aid!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No one could survive an explosion like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But the Alguacil..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I said, no."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Will we let his martyrdom go to waste, sacrificing the living for the sake of the departed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Warrior Priest",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But what if he's still—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aarón needs you now more than ever. Take inventory of the confiscated supplies, and round up the prisoners."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silver",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is an order."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Steady! You're gonna snap the mast in two!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you trying to crash the ship on those bones and have us hang on them to dry like human jerky?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Full left rudder!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Teach",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Full left rudder!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Weedy",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Damage to the starboard side! Another hit from a steam blast, and this ship's going to fall apart!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The skeleton formations are getting denser! We'll crash if we don't steer this just right!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Teach",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The erupting steam means we're close to the Skeletal Reef."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Teach",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They won't dare go in there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But do we? The steam blasts will punch through us like a hot knife through butter!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Teach",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Better than the Inquisition, at least!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Ugh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Boiling steam shoots out of gaps in the skeletons and tears the sail apart with terrible force.\nThe gang is thrown into the air before crashing back onto the deck.\nThe helm wheel spins wildly out of control. Gushing steam sends the ship crashing towards a massive skeleton more than a dozen meters tall!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Juana says nothing, as if waiting for something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Weedy! You're an engineer! Do something!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Weedy",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is my first time on a Golden Age ship, never mind one that's been modified beyond recognition! I need time to figure out how it works!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do we abandon ship? We might survive if we jump right now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you loco?! You'll be impaled by saltfins in less than a minute!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Teach",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Señora!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're done for..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, we're not."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Juana looks towards the spinning helm wheel.\nIf the ship were alive, its flesh would have been stripped away by a century of wear, leaving only a bare skeleton. Even its once-magnificent embroidered sail was replaced with a patchwork of finskin.\nYet, the helm stands proud at the deck's center."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Juana halts the spinning helm wheel with her hands, as if steadying a dance partner, and begins to turn it with a frenzied rhythm. Her ink-black hair whips around like seaweed caught in raging tides."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Juana",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's been so long, old friend!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "La Conquista brushes past the massive skeleton, banking at a dangerous angle. Only by hanging onto a rope for dear life did the passengers avoid being thrown overboard.\nFor decades, this heavy old ship has had to drift slowly behind other salt ships.\nNow, though, it darts through the bones, riding upon the wind, as it once navigated treacherous reefs with Juana at the helm."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Teach",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Señora...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W-We're on course again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*pant*... *pant*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pascuala",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I... I'm alive? Do I have all my body parts? Am I hanging off a piece of bone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Weedy",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You said... YOU SAID YOU ONLY NEEDED ME TO PUT OUT A FIRE!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, figuratively... right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's the situation, Thorns? How much of the lab is left?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They stand in silence before the carnage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I managed to salvage the transmutation table. The outer casing is gone, but the output's stable enough..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As for the probes... this is the only one left. Pretty worn, but still usable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And we still have a little bit of alloy and Originium, scavenged from the antiques. I don't know if it's enough though..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anything I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are your fingers as thin as a probe needle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A long rumble interrupts the conversation as Elysium places a hand on his belly, looking embarrassed."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At this rate, they might be soon. We don't have much food on the ship..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Isidro",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Let's go find some."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
